{
  "file_id": "ID03564",
  "text_count": 39,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "It's a big one! Let's haul it in!",
      "_offset": 24,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "W-what?! We caught a Digimon?!",
      "_offset": 58,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "You've gotta be kidding me!",
      "_offset": 89,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Ah, that was a shock. It really\nwas a big one, Jou.",
      "_offset": 117,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Jou! What's wrong?",
      "_offset": 169,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Broken?!",
      "_offset": 188,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "?? Did you break your leg?",
      "_offset": 197,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "?? Did you break your leg?",
      "_offset": 224,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "No! I broke my brother's fishing\nrod!",
      "_offset": 251,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Eeeeeeeeeeeh?!",
      "_offset": 289,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "What am I gonna do? We took his\nfishing rod without permission,\nand on top of that we broke it...",
      "_offset": 304,
      "_length": 97,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "What do I tell him? Hey, Gomamon,\nwhat should we do...",
      "_offset": 402,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "No choice but to just be honest\nand apologize.",
      "_offset": 457,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "N-no way...",
      "_offset": 504,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "I'm sorry, Shin!",
      "_offset": 516,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Sneaking in, taking your fishing\nrod, and on top of that breaking\nit...",
      "_offset": 537,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "I don't know if you'll forgive me.\nI can pay you back with my pocket\nmoney, little by little...",
      "_offset": 609,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "It's fine, Jou.",
      "_offset": 705,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 721,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "I'm glad you're taking an interest\nin things other than studying.",
      "_offset": 726,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Shin...?",
      "_offset": 792,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "You've been working really hard to\nbecome a doctor, just like Dad\nsaid.",
      "_offset": 801,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "But as your older brother, I want\nyou to be able to have fun like a\nnormal kid.",
      "_offset": 873,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "I didn't know you were thinking\nsomething like that...",
      "_offset": 953,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Anyway, I have to go. Go put the\nbroken fishing rod in the storage\nroom.",
      "_offset": 1008,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Y-yeah. I'm really sorry.",
      "_offset": 1081,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Hey, Jou!",
      "_offset": 1107,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "W-what?",
      "_offset": 1117,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "I feel like you've changed a bit.\nLike you've become a bit more\nresilient.",
      "_offset": 1125,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Is that so.",
      "_offset": 1200,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Yeah! Before, you would have kept\nquiet about that broken fishing\nrod!",
      "_offset": 1212,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Really?!",
      "_offset": 1283,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Ahaha, see you.",
      "_offset": 1292,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Yeah.",
      "_offset": 1308,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "See? Just like I said, right?",
      "_offset": 1314,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Yeah! And I'm glad I got to know\nhow my brother feels.",
      "_offset": 1344,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Okay, now I want a hamburger as my\nreward.",
      "_offset": 1399,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Huh?! Do I have enough pocket\nmoney for that?",
      "_offset": 1442,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Hahaha!",
      "_offset": 1488,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}